[176.902474, "o", "Number of answers: 10\r\nValidating QID: b2531657ba5c7a78 (factual)\r\nValidating QID: 6f12607a1ba14dd5 (factual)\r\nValidating QID: mixed-2a90a3df19df68 (factual)\r\nValidating QID: mixed-7c14643ec4356a (factual)\r\nValidating QID: daef650b92e56473 (numeric)\r\nValidating QID: a0576a26f2a2eeac (numeric)\r\nValidating QID: near-miss-04f3afa658fdef (refusal)\r\nValidating QID: near-miss-0c6ec72416151f (refusal)\r\nValidating QID: mixed-eead76662cb6bf (multihop)\r\nValidating QID: mixed-97331106c3870d (multihop)\r\nAll validations passed successfully!\r\n"]
